{"d":"Le Rivage Immobilier vous propose à la location une charmante villa S4 située dans un quartier calme et sécurisé à la Marsa.\nLe rez-de-chaussée se compose d’un salon lumineux, qui ouvre sur une belle terrasse et la piscine, d’une salle à manger, d’une pièce polyvalente idéale pour un bureau, d’une salle d’eau pour les invités, d’une cuisine entièrement équipée ainsi que d’une chambre de service avec sa propre douche.\nÀ l’étage, vous découvrirez une suite parentale spacieuse et deux chambres confortables qui se partageant une salle de douche.\nÀ l’extérieur, vous profiterez d’un agréable jardin joliment arboré, d’une terrasse conviviale, d’une piscine et d’un garage.","ph":["https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077066_property_xlarge_80214220.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077051_property_xlarge_80214221.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077053_property_xlarge_80214222.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077056_property_xlarge_80214223.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077057_property_xlarge_80214224.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077059_property_xlarge_80214225.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077060_property_xlarge_80214226.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077062_property_xlarge_80214227.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077063_property_xlarge_80214228.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077064_property_xlarge_80214229.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077067_property_xlarge_80214230.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077068_property_xlarge_80214231.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077070_property_xlarge_80214232.avif","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/136/545F/h/thumb_1077071_property_xlarge_80214233.avif","https://www.mubawab-m